[b]CSS v1.0.0-beta.9[/b]

[list]
[*]Other mods can now read and change your current look: palettes, toggles, colours and sliders, either saved or just for the moment.
[*]CINE uses this to animate your outfit during a cinematic take and put your own look back afterwards.
[/list]

CSS works exactly the same with or without CSSX installed. Modders: the service is documented in [url=https://github.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/blob/main/docs/services.md]docs/services.md[/url].

Close the game, extract into [b]MortalShell2/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/[/b] and overwrite. Keep your [b]CustomShellSystem/state/[/b] folder.
